<view class="page">
 <view class="row"><text class="eyebrow">MBTI TRANSLATOR</text><text class="pill">让沟通靠近一点</text></view>
 <view class="title">你的意思，<view>换个方式被理解。</view></view>
 <view class="subtitle">保留真实的你，找到更合适的表达。</view>
 <view class="banner" wx:if="{{demo}}">人格示例版 · 选择对方 MBTI，看看同一句话如何变化。自定义原话需接入 AI。</view>
 <view class="section-heading"><text class="step">01</text><text class="label">这次，想和谁聊聊？</text></view>
 <view class="scenes"><button wx:for="{{scenes}}" wx:key="id" class="scene {{scene === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectScene"><view class="scene-icon">{{item.icon}}</view><view class="scene-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="scene-hint">{{item.hint}}</view></button></view>
 <view class="card people"><view class="person"><text class="muted">我的 MBTI</text><picker range="{{types}}" value="{{mineIndex}}" data-field="mineIndex" bindchange="selectType"><view class="type">{{types[mineIndex]}} <text class="chevron">⌄</text></view></picker></view><button class="swap" bindtap="swap" aria-label="交换双方 MBTI">⇄</button><view class="person"><text class="muted">对方的 MBTI</text><picker range="{{types}}" value="{{theirsIndex}}" data-field="theirsIndex" bindchange="selectType"><view class="type">{{types[theirsIndex]}} <text class="chevron">⌄</text></view></picker></view></view>
 <view class="section-heading"><text class="step">02</text><text class="label">你想表达什么？</text></view>
 <view class="tabs"><button class="tab {{mode === 'rewrite' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="rewrite" bindtap="selectMode">帮我换个说法</button><button class="tab {{mode === 'organize' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="organize" bindtap="selectMode">帮我组织意思</button></view>
 <view class="card editor"><textarea value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" data-field="text" maxlength="2000" auto-height="{{false}}" adjust-position="{{true}}" cursor-spacing="100" placeholder="{{mode === 'rewrite' ? '写下准备发出去的话，直说也没关系…' : '不用组织语言，把你的想法、感受和诉求写在这里…'}}" placeholder-class="placeholder"/><view class="row"><button class="text-button" bindtap="example">↗ 试试一个例子</button><text class="muted">{{text.length}} / 2000</text></view><view wx:if="{{demo && text && !isExample}}" class="demo-warning">当前公开版还没有 AI 服务，无法改写这段自定义内容。点击上方示例可体验不同 MBTI 的表达差异。</view></view>
 <view class="card extras"><view class="row" bindtap="toggle"><text class="label">补充一点背景 <text class="muted">选填</text></text><text class="muted">{{expanded ? '收起 −' : '展开 ＋'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{expanded}}" class="extra-fields"><text class="muted">这次沟通想达到什么目的？</text><input value="{{purpose}}" data-field="purpose" bindinput="input" maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：拒绝邀请，但保留善意"/><text class="muted">对方实际偏好怎样的表达？</text><input value="{{preference}}" data-field="preference" bindinput="input" maxlength="200" placeholder="例如：先给结论，再解释原因"/></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
 <button class="primary generate" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !canSubmit}}">{{busy ? '正在斟酌表达…' : (demo ? (isExample ? '看看人格适配示例 →' : '自定义改写待接入 AI') : '翻译一下 →')}}</button>
 <view class="note">MBTI 仅作参考，真实沟通偏好更重要。<view>更好地表达，不代表改变你的立场。</view></view>
</view>
